    "title": "I-680 Northbound reopens after crash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Marty Burke No media credit provided. ,\n4 hours ago\nYOUNGSTOWN, Ohio (WKBN) — A portion of Interstate 680 Northbound and multiple entrance ramps were shut down near Meridian Road Wednesday evening after a crash on the interstate.\nAccording to dispatch, a motorcycle and an SUV were involved in a crash around 7:20 p.m. No other information was given.\nThe crash has been cleared, and traffic is flowing again.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WKBN.com.",
